-- HOLE IN A TAG OR ATTRIBUTE NAME ------------------------------ main.kl  K1614

This hole is in a tag name or an attribute name. Names decide what the markup does, so they must be written in the literal.

3│     let page = html"""<{tag}>hi</p>"""
                           ^^^

Help: Write the name literally. For a changing set of attributes, use `Attrs`, whose names are a fixed list.

Learn more: kalam explain K1614
